319	                    <td>:68</td>
320	                </tr>
321	                <tr>
322	                    <td class="filename">LegacySensorManager.java</td>
323	                    <td class="class-name">final class LegacySensorManager</td>
324	                    <td class="responsibility">遗留传感器管理器实现。支持旧版SensorListener API(已deprecated)。监听屏幕旋转变化，为旧API提供旋转补偿。与IWindowManager通信获取旋转状态。</td>
325	                    <td><span class="type-badge type-supporting">Supporting</span></td>
326	                    <td>:35</td>
327	                </tr>
328	                <tr>
329	                    <td class="filename">SensorPrivacyManager.java</td>
330	                    <td class="class-name">public final class SensorPrivacyManager</td>
331	                    <td class="responsibility">传感器隐私管理器。提供麦克风和相机切换(Privacy Toggle)的查询和控制功能。通过Binder与服务端通信，实现用户级和传感器级的隐私开关状态管理。@SystemService(Context.SENSOR_PRIVACY_SERVICE)</td>
332	                    <td><span class="type-badge type-supporting">Supporting</span></td>
333	                    <td>:54</td>
334	                </tr>
335	                <tr>
336	                    <td class="filename">SensorPrivacyManagerInternal.java</td>
337	                    <td class="class-name">public abstract class SensorPrivacyManagerInternal</td>
338	                    <td class="responsibility">传感器隐私管理器内部接口。供系统服务使用。提供isSensorPrivacyEnabled()查询、addSensorPrivacyListener()监听、setPhysicalToggleSensorPrivacy()设置硬件开关状态等功能。支持用户级和全局级监听器。</td>
339	                    <td><span class="type-badge type-supporting">Supporting</span></td>
340	                    <td>:23</td>
341	                </tr>
342	                <tr>
343	                    <td class="filename">SensorListener.java</td>
344	                    <td class="class-name">@Deprecated public abstract class SensorListener</td>
345	                    <td class="responsibility">遗留的传感器监听器抽象类(API Level < 3)。已被SensorEventListener取代。定义onSensorChanged(int sensor, float[] values)和onAccuracyChanged(int sensor, int accuracy)方法。@deprecated since API level 3</td>
346	                    <td><span class="type-badge type-supporting">Supporting</span></td>
347	                    <td>待确认</td>
348	                </tr>
